        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6420 Rope Bristol Entrance Trim Set with Matching Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBaldwin's 6420 Bristol Entrance Trim Set is made out of solid brass and comes backed by a limited lifetime mechanical warranty. The historic design of the Bristol Entrance Set features an arched top and bottom. The shape is reminiscent of European architectural elements. The coordinating handle features a curved shape and the classic rope edge adds luster. All mounting screws are concealed from the exterior to ensure an aesthetically clean appearance. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\" for a door thickness of 1-3/4\". Available with either a single cylinder or a full dummy set function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Baldwin Tubular Entrance Trim Set is designed for easy installation for standard pre-drilled wood or metal doors. It is fully reversible to accommodate all door conditions. Forged out of solid brass, it is built to last and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty to assure that it meets the Baldwin standards of excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 6420 Bristol Traditional Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Entrance handle, cylinder collar, knob, rose and turn piece are manufactured from solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability. </li>\r\n<li>Estate locksets are designed for easy installation in standard pre-bored wood or metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Locksets accommodate a door thickness of 1-3/4”. Conversion kit available for 2” and 2-1/4” thick doors at an additional charge.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt and latch case are formed of steel for strength. Most interior working parts are made of solid brass or steel for maximum strength and smooth operation.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset 2-3/8” or 2-3/4” latch and deadbolt supplied standard.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt and latch supplied with a 1” face plate</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt is furnished with a steel reinforcing strike, two 3” security jamb screws and is covered with an armored front to conceal the fasteners and guard against theft. </li> \r\n<li>Latches are supplied standard with a full lip strike.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass deadbolt has 1” throw when extended and a hardened steel insert for maximum protection and security. </li> \r\n<li>Solid brass latch bolt has a 1/2” throw when extended to fully engage the door jamb.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Cylinder supplied with 5-pin keying.</li>\r\n<li>Keys are designed with a 1-1/4” wide bow surface.</li>\r\n<li>Fully Reversible to accommodate most door conditions and facilitate installation</li>\r\n<li>Lockset accommodates any latch to deadbolt center to center measurement greater than 4-3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Designed to fit 2-1/8” face bore with no additional hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and PVD (003) polished brass finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Tubular Bristol Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5064 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Length: 3.87\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Length: 3.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Projection: 2.85\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 9.98\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 2.23\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6420.pdf?v=1691094971\" target=\"new\"><b>Bristol Entrance Trim Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Bristol Two Piece Entrance Trim Set, Baldwin 6420",
                "description": "Baldwin 6420 Bristol Entrance Trim - Baldwin's 6420 Bristol Entrance Trim Set is made out of solid brass and comes backed by a limited lifetime mechanical warranty. The historic design of the Bristol Entrance Set features an arched top and bottom. The shape is reminiscent of European architectural elements. The coordinating handle features a curved shape and the classic rope edge adds luster. All mounting screws are concealed from the exterior to ensure an aesthetically clean appearance. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches for a door thickness of 1-3/4 inches. Available with either a single cylinder or a full dummy set function.",
                "keywords": "baldwin 6420 Bristol Entrance Trims, BAL-6420, Baldwin Bristol Tubular Entrance Trim Sets, traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, arched handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, emergency egress handlesets, baldwin estates collection entrance trim sets, rope entry sets, colonial rope handlesets, two piece handlesets, sectional entrance sets, bladwin 6420 Briston sectional entrance trim sets,"
